<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="zh-CN">
<head>
<meta charset="UTF-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width,initial-scale=1,maximum-scale=1,user-scalable=no,viewport-fit=cover">
<title>竞技场枪战 · 启动</title>
<style>
  html,body{
    margin:0;padding:0;width:100%;height:100%;
    background:#000;color:#fff;
    display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;
    font-family:system-ui,-apple-system,"Segoe UI",Roboto,"PingFang SC","Microsoft YaHei",sans-serif;
    -webkit-tap-highlight-color:transparent;user-select:none;
    overflow-y:auto;
  }
  .wrap{
    text-align:center;
    padding:40px 24px;
    width:100%;
    max-width:520px;
  }
  h1{
    font-size:clamp(28px,6vw,48px);
    font-weight:800;letter-spacing:6px;
    margin:0 0 8px;
    border-bottom:2px solid #fff;
    padding-bottom:14px;
  }
  .sub{
    font-size:clamp(10px,1.8vw,13px);
    letter-spacing:3px;color:#888;
    margin:0 0 36px;
  }
  .list{
    display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:10px;
  }
  .item{
    display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between;
    padding:14px 20px;
    border:2px solid #fff;
    color:#fff;background:#000;
    text-decoration:none;
    font-size:clamp(14px,2vw,16px);
    font-weight:600;letter-spacing:2px;
    transition:background .15s,color .15s;
  }
  .item:hover,.item:active{background:#fff;color:#000;}
  .hint{
    margin-top:28px;font-size:11px;
    letter-spacing:2px;color:#444;
  }
</style>
</head>
<body>
  <div class="wrap">
    <h1>竞技场枪战</h1>
    <div class="sub">ARENA GUNFIGHT · 选择版本</div>

    <div class="list">
      <a class="item" href=".html"><span>.html</span></a>
      <a class="item" href="./ (1).html"><span>(1).html</span></a>
      <a class="item" href="./ (2).html"><span>(2).html</span></a>
      <a class="item" href="./ (3).html"><span>(3).html</span></a>
      <a class="item" href="./ (4).html"><span>(4).html</span></a>
      <a class="item" href="./3d 版.html"><span>3d 版.html</span></a>
      <a class="item" href="./3d 版 (1).html"><span>3d 版 (1).html</span></a>
      <a class="item" href="./3d 版 (2).html"><span>3d 版 (2).html</span></a>
      <a class="item" href="./3d 版 (3).html"><span>3d 版 (3).html</span></a>
      <a class="item" href="./3d 版 (4).html"><span>3d 版 (4).html</span></a>
      <a class="item" href="./3d 版 (5).html"><span>3d 版 (5).html</span></a>
      <a class="item" href="./3d 版 (6).html"><span>3d 版 (6).html</span></a>
      <a class="item" href="./3d 版 (7).html"><span>3d 版 (7).html</span></a>
      <a class="item" href="./Redmi.md"><span>Redmi.md</span></a>
    </div>

    <div class="hint">WASD 移动 · 鼠标瞄准 · 左键射击</div>
  </div>
</body>
</html>